      <p class="ar-lede">Almost any garment factory in China can sew a bomber jacket. Far fewer can hold rib tension across a 2,000-piece run, set a zipper that doesn't ripple the placket, and keep quilted lining from collapsing after three home washes. That gap is what this guide is about. Ten factory profiles follow, but the order matters less than the criteria behind it. Read the evaluation framework first, then match a factory type to your order profile rather than to a number on a list</p>
